      "statement": "Dashboard GitHub OAuth issues a seven-day HS256 session JWT signed with DASHBOARD_JWT_SECRET; the session includes GitHub identity and application user ID, require_session rejects absent or invalid cookies, and /me can answer from the session when the user record is unavailable.",
